<title>DENMARK: Topdanmark posts improved 1996 H1 profits.</title>
<headline>Topdanmark posts improved 1996 H1 profits.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group result			 120  vs 22</p>
<p> Insurance result		    138 vs 115</p>
<p> Own capital end-June 1996     2,765 vs 2,642 end-June 1995</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Denmark's third biggest insurance group is Topdanmark A/S. In a statement it repeated earlier forecasts of an expected profit for full year 1996 between 140-190 million crowns.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969650</p>
